# External systems (local)

Part of the [[README]]. The systems this vault connects to, beyond the kit's rows in [[external-systems]]: one row each, saying what the system owns, what agents may do there, and what they never do. A system agents must never write to also gets its URL pattern in `lint.read_only_url_patterns` of `.tidyvault.yml`. The kit never changes this page.

| System | Owns | Agents may | Agents may not |
|---|---|---|---|
